\subsection{Effective interactions}
\subsubsection{The importance of twisted-chain corrections\label{ssec:vtwist}}

It remains the question of the importance of non-parquet diagrams.  We
have, so far, seen two different scenarios: In a model calculation for
a fictitious system of bosons with spins \cite{SpinTwist} the effect
was seen to be quite dramatic whereas we have here seen practically no
change in the energy.
\begin{figure}[H]
