The remainder of the paper is organized as follows. Section~\ref{sec.model} introduces the mathematical model of the vessel's roll motion. Section~\ref{sec.contr} addresses the control design and related stability considerations. Section~\ref{sec.simul} presents simulation results that demonstrate the effectiveness of the proposed controller on a realistic vessel model used by Navis JSC for Hardware-in-the-Loop testing.
