\section{Mathematical Modelling}\label{sec.model}

The ship’s roll motion is driven by the disturbance moment $M_w(t)$, primarily wave-induced, and is counteracted by the control moment $M_u(t)$, which must be delivered by actuators of sufficient speed and power.
