\Omega^{\pm}_{\bm k, z}=\mp
sign(B_y)
\frac{ k_zk_y (P/\sqrt{3})^4 }
{2 [M^2_0 + k^2_y  (P/\sqrt{3})^2 ]^{1/2} [ M^2_0 + k^2 (P/\sqrt{3})^2]^{3/2}} 
