	\subsection{The classes \(\mathcal K_s\) and \(\mathcal K^\star\)}

	A power series \(f(z)=\sum_{n\ge0}a_nz^n\in\mathcal K\) lies in \(\mathcal K^\star\) if 
	\[
	M_f:=\lim_{t\uparrow R}m_f(t)>1,
