\end{prop}

\begin{proof}
The map $G$ is $T^3$-equivariant for the given $T^3$-actions. It in onto $M_{Q}^{5}$. For  $(z_0, z_1, z_2, |z_3|, z_4, z_5)\in M_{Q}^{5}$, where 
