\]
In addition, 
\[
z_{0}^{'}|z_{5}|^{'} + z_{2}^{'}|z_{3}^{'}| = t_1z_0 \frac{1}{t_1}z_5 + z_2|z_3| =z_1|z_4| = t_{2}z_{1}^{'}\frac{1}{t_2}|z_{4}^{'}| = z_{1}^{'}|z_{4}^{'}|, 
\]
which means that $(z_{0}^{'} : z_{1}^{'}: z_{2}^{'}: |z_{3}^{'}|: |z_{4}^{'}|: |z_{5}^{'}|)\in M^{3}$. The statement  that $G$ is one to one follows from the fact that $|z_4|, |z_5|\neq 0$. 
\end{proof}

