performance according to our model for all the operators in our
benchmark suite. Each test case in our suite is labeled using the naming
convention $\{\mathrm{Operator}\}.\{n\}\mathrm{D}.\mathrm{P}\{p\}$, where
\textit{Operator} represents the name of the operator in the corresponding
variational form, $n$ denotes the spatial dimension, and $p$ signifies the
degree of the function space chosen.

