$$
\al^{(n)}_s=\der^J_0\der^J_1\cdots\der^J_{n-1}(V_{J_n}v_n^s)\mbx{for $V_{J_n}v_n^s\in H^0BP_*/J_n$.}
$$
Here, $V_{J_n}=p^{e_0-1}v_1^{e_1-1}\dots v_{n-1}^{e_{n-1}-1}$.

