We note that the successful fit results observed in \Cref{fig:fit_price_full_model} are not exclusive to the day chosen. Indeed, we observe that the results seem to carry over similarly for all of the trading days in the dataset with the average mean-squared error across all contracts on a given observation day around $0.000185$, that is $\approx 1.85$ basis points of the average yield.


\begin{figure}[h!]\label{fig:full_model_mse}
